- CURL CREAM FOR CURLY HAIR & CURLING CREAM — A versatile leave-in conditioner and curl cream for curly hair that provides intense hydration, frizz control, and lasting shine. This rich curling cream and hair cream formula with concentrated Aloe Vera helps support softness, bounce, and natural movement for 2B, 2C, 3A, 3B, and 3C textures — zero crunch, zero weight. An essential among curly hair products for wavy, curly, and coily textures seeking real hydration and all-day hold.
- AIR DRY CREAM & ANTI FRIZZ HAIR PRODUCTS — A lightweight air dry cream for hair that provides lasting frizz control and curl definition without heat styling. Helps visibly smooth frizz and enhance natural shine — leaving dull, undefined hair looking glossy, soft, and luminous. Effective frizz control hair products and anti frizz hair products for all curl textures. Also works as a curl cream for wavy hair that needs lasting hold and definition without crunch or residue.
- ALOE VERA, KERATIN & HYDRATING ACTIVES — Formulated with concentrated Aloe Vera to help lock in moisture and soothe the scalp, a Keratin concentrate to help strengthen and smooth each strand, and hydrating actives to support elasticity and resilience. A lightweight hair conditioner and strengthening hair treatment that helps support deep hydration from wash day through day four. Free from harsh sulfates and parabens. Safe for colour-treated, bleached, and chemically processed hair.
- HAIR DETANGLER & STYLING CREAM FOR ALL CURL ROUTINES — Apply to damp hair as a daily curl cream and hair detangler for effortless definition and slip. Works as a versatile air dry cream and styling cream across all curl routines — co-wash, low-poo, wash-and-go, twist-out, and diffuse. A hair styling cream essential among wavy hair products and hair products for Type 2B through Type 3C textures. Also suitable for Type 4A through 4C curls seeking lightweight hydration and frizz control.
- BRAZILIAN HAIR PRODUCTS FOR WOMEN — TRUSTED WORLDWIDE — Super Bonita is an authentic Brazilian hair care brand, formulated in Rio de Janeiro and trusted by women across international markets. Aloe Vera Comb Cream is a curly hair conditioner and conditioner for women with 2B through 3C textures can rely on — from loose waves to tight curls. Trusted hair products for women that work as a conditioner for dry damaged hair at an accessible price. 800ml / 27 fl.oz.:

