data.inputPrompt:
Use the following JSON prompt, the ingredient list, the image of the product packaging, the image of the product consistency, and the description of the product consistency to generate the image,

the ingredients and the consistency description are attached at the bottom of the prompt.

See the PRODUCT_DIMENSIONS to have a reference of scale 15.5cm x 12.5cm x 12.5cm 900ml

{
"task": "Generate a high-end, minimalistic haircare ingredient explainer image using reference product photography and dynamic ingredient inputs",

"input_parameters": {
"reference_product_images": {
"description": "List of product reference images. If multiple products appear in the image (ex: 2-bottle routine), automatically isolate and use only ONE primary bottle (hero bottle) for dispensing in the scene.",
"type": "array",
"max_primary_products_used": 1
},

"ingredients": {
"description": "List of ingredient objects. System will auto-generate benefit text and icons if missing.",
"type": "array",
"structure": {
