rracotta. At the top of the infographic, a header bar in a semi-transparent crisp white with the Probelle Super Bonita logo and the line 'CRESPO BABOSA — CREME DE PENTEAR 800mL' in elegant sans-serif. At the bottom, a subtle footer strip in emerald green with the text 'High Performance Curl Activation • Control & Definition • For Coily & Kinky Hair' in crisp white minimal font. The overall color grading is warm, highly saturated, reminiscent of vintage 35mm film travel editorial photography, with glowing warm skin-tone-friendly tones, rich contrast, and a breezy, sun-baked, effortlessly chic Brazilian Tropicália atmosphere. No people in the composition. Shot in a photorealistic high-end product photography style with shallow depth of field on the background courtyard environment and tack-sharp focus on the product and ingredient vignettes."
